{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12683","headline":"招孟武昌 · 元结","name":"招孟武昌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风霜枯万物，退谷如春时。\n穷冬涸江海，桮湖澄清漪。\n湖尽到谷口，单船近堦墀。\n湖中更何好，坐见大江水。\n欹石爲水涯，半山在湖里。\n谷口更何好，绝壑流寒泉。\n松桂荫茅舍，白云生坐边。\n武昌不干进，武昌人不厌。\n退谷正可游，桮湖任来泛。\n湖上有水鸟，见人不飞鸣。\n谷口有山兽，往往随人行。\n莫将车马来，令我鸟兽惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}